{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"localLogout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK\/GettingStarted"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The counterpart of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK\/BlueGPS\/logout(parameters:contextProvider:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for a session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that is already gone. Clears the stored token, its keychain item and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"background credentials, and rebuilds the URL session without a bearer.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Prefer it whenever the SDK has reported the session invalid through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK\/BlueGPS\/sessionInvalidated","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": there is no identity-provider session left to end,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the end-session web step has nothing to clear and renders the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider’s own page instead of redirecting back. Presenting nothing also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"means this cannot fail, and it never starts an interactive login — that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays strictly user-initiated.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the logout, it stops the background session, tag advertising and beacon","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking first: afterwards no one is signed in.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Signs out on this device only: no web step, no UI, nothing presented.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"localLogout()","externalID":"s:11SynapsesSDK7BlueGPSC11localLogoutyyF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"localLogout"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"extendedModule":"SynapsesSDK","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SynapsesSDK"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK","doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK\/BlueGPS"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK\/BlueGPS\/localLogout()"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/synapsessdk\/bluegps\/locallogout()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK/documentation/SynapsesSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/synapsessdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Indoor positioning, resource booking and facility management for iOS."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK\/documentation\/SynapsesSDK","title":"SynapsesSDK"},"doc://com.synapseslab.BlueGPS.SynapsesSDK/documentation/SynapsesSDK/BlueGPS/sessionInvalidated":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sessionInvalidated"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine18PassthroughSubjectC","text":"Passthroug